  <name>Jacarium</name>
  <summary>Everything you know and use for technical work, in one place.</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Jacarium keeps your notes, cases and tools for technical work in one place:
      documents with real-time collaboration, Taskwarrior and Jira integration, a
      workflow builder, diagnostics for support reports and AI assistance.
      Everything you know and use for technical work, in one place.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Document management with real-time collaboration</li>
      <li>TaskWarrior integration for task tracking</li>
      <li>JIRA integration for issue management</li>
      <li>Advanced search and filtering</li>
      <li>AI-powered analysis and diagnostics</li>
      <li>Workflow builder for automation</li>
      <li>Cloud synchronization support</li>
      <li>Multi-instance task management</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">com.jacarium.app.desktop</launchable>
